Bug A2: skyDarken is never tracked
Files: `pumpkin/src/world/mod.rs`, `get_max_local_raw_brightness`
What is wrong: It always passes `ambient_darkness = 0`, with a TODO saying the 
sky darken value is not tracked. Grass spreads at night as if it were noon, and 
night mob spawning thresholds are wrong.
Verified vanilla behaviour: Sky light is reduced by an ambient darkness derived 
from time of day.
